      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1x3xemm'
    '|a||A dollar more an hour, on nine and a half hours a day, is nine dollars fifty a day before she changes anything.':
