      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1wm8dgz'
    '|b||And once the bills are paid, an extra free evening is worth more to most of us than one more thing to buy.':
