      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1yxi69n'
    '|b||And a big lottery win? Nothing about the price of an hour changes.':
