      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1qn4f8a'
    '|a||Then only the income pull works: fewer hours at every wage, and the whole curve drops.':
