      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1nd03vv'
    '|b||So the curve can bend back. Does it, for real people? The cleanest test of the income pull is money that falls from the sky.':
