      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1ias4i6'
    '|a||A Swede wins a million kronor, about $140,000. What happens to her yearly pay over the next ten years?':
